// # Phys Quantum -- Quantum Computing, Open Systems, Tensor Networks, Topological
//
// Logline: Quantum computing (gates, circuits, algorithms, VQE, QAOA, Shor), open quantum systems (Lindblad, Redfield, master equations), tensor networks (DMRG, PEPS, MERA, TEBD), topological quantum (anyons, surface code, FQHE). Phase 3.4 reorg: merged from phys/quantum/, phys/quantum_advanced/, phys/quantum_open_systems/, phys/quantum_tensor_nets/, phys/quantum_topological/, plus the root quantum files (berry_curvature_law, kitaev_majorana_principle, syk_entropy_law).
//
// Setup: Co-located module of 229 files under std/science/phys/quantum. Pure compute, no caps.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Quantum gates and circuit family (Hadamard, Pauli, CNOT, Toffoli, rotation).
//   2. Quantum algorithms family (Grover, Shor, VQE, QAOA, QFT, HHL).
//   3. Open quantum systems family (Lindblad, Redfield, master equation, quantum jump).
//   4. Tensor network family (DMRG, PEPS, MERA, TEBD, MPO, MPS).
//   5. Topological quantum family (anyons, surface code, toric code, FQHE).
//   6. Quantum error correction family (stabilizer codes, magic state distillation).

